WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.400
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.100
Tap Select

3
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.300
Tap each task you want to change

4
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.100
One…

5
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.000
…two…

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.900
…three

7
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.400
The bar counts them

8
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.900
Change them all at once

9
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.000
In Progress, say

10
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:44.500
All three are In Progress — and Undo is right there
